# ==============================================================================
# SERVERLESS EMAIL DISPATCH CONFIGURATION (STATIC SITES / GITHUB PAGES)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Choose your preferred serverless provider:
#
# 1. OPTION A: Web3Forms (Recommended - Free 250 emails/month, 0 signup delay)
#    Get your access key in 30 seconds from: https://web3forms.com
#    Enter your email (kanaseabhimanyu@gmail.com) and paste the key here:
# VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here
#
# 2. OPTION B: Formspree (Free 50 emails/month)
#    Create a form at https://formspree.io and paste your endpoint here:
